{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eqEweyyEOK1794902454.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，繼續由蔡天鳳前大伯鄺港傑作供，強調案發當日他在龍尾村一直是「強裝冷靜」，聽從父親鄺球的指示行動。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206811-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E6%A1%88%E7%99%BC%E7%95%B6%E6%97%A5%E5%BC%B7%E8%A3%9D%E5%86%B7%E9%9D%9C%E8%81%BD%E5%BE%9E%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E6%8C%87%E7%A4%BA%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑強調案發當日「強裝冷靜」　聽從父親鄺球指示行動</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206811-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E6%A1%88%E7%99%BC%E7%95%B6%E6%97%A5%E5%BC%B7%E8%A3%9D%E5%86%B7%E9%9D%9C%E8%81%BD%E5%BE%9E%E7%88%B6%E8%A6%AA%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E6%8C%87%E7%A4%BA%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜控方引述法醫指蔡頭部或遭鎚擊七下　鄺港傑：沒看到發生毆打</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一間私家醫院9月涉嫌錯誤切除一名女病人的雙側卵巢。涉事的中大醫院表示高度關注，已向病人及家屬致歉，並作全面檢討。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206795-%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%A7%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A29%E6%9C%88%E6%B6%89%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4%E5%88%87%E9%99%A445%E6%AD%B2%E5%A5%B3%E7%97%85%E4%BA%BA%E9%9B%99%E5%81%B4%E5%8D%B5%E5%B7%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>中大醫院9月涉錯誤切除45歲女病人雙側卵巢</strong></a></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超在一個論壇指，本港要在國際幻變局勢下更好融入及服務國家發展大局。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206790-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B%E5%B1%80%E5%8B%A2%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8D%E6%87%89%E8%A2%AB%E5%8B%95%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E8%A6%81%E6%9B%B4%E5%A5%BD%E8%9E%8D%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%8A%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E5%9C%8B%E5%AE%B6%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95%E5%A4%A7%E5%B1%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>李家超：面對國際局勢香港不應被動應對　要更好融入及服務國家發展大局</strong></a></p><p></p><p>亞洲物流航運及空運會議在灣仔會展舉行。有逾80位講者，包括政府官員及環球業界人士參與，一同探討全球供應鏈變革等。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206791-%E7%81%A3%E4%BB%94%E6%9C%83%E5%B1%95%E8%88%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%9E%E6%B4%B2%E7%89%A9%E6%B5%81%E8%88%AA%E9%81%8B%E5%8F%8A%E7%A9%BA%E9%81%8B%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E6%8E%A2%E8%A8%8E%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E4%BE%9B%E6%87%89%E9%8F%88%E8%AE%8A%E9%9D%A9%E7%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>灣仔會展舉行亞洲物流航運及空運會議　探討全球供應鏈變革等</strong></a></p><p></p><p>生產力局成立無人機任務管理中心，整合低空經濟航線運作。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206829-%E7%94%9F%E7%94%A2%E5%8A%9B%E5%B1%80%E6%88%90%E7%AB%8B%E7%84%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%A9%9F%E4%BB%BB%E5%8B%99%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E6%95%B4%E5%90%88%E4%BD%8E%E7%A9%BA%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E8%88%AA%E7%B7%9A%E9%81%8B%E4%BD%9C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>生產力局成立無人機任務管理中心　整合低空經濟航線運作</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.049954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":448,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:14.881833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:29.376088+00:00","content_hash":"6e9bc9d111ee5a1ab475238597f309ad6f3a5228df5e8e86251282b8e5c00c37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.049954+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}